{"id":"0a7da8597661ed59","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Finite Union Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class — ZFC Finite Union Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class — ZFC Finite Union Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-union.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-finite-union-closed-class — ZFC Finite Union Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-union.md\">../batch02/58-df-union.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is a class variable</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup:V\\to V\">\\(\\bigcup:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-union.md\">../batch02/58-df-union.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteUnionClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteUnionClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\text{-}union\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteUnionClosedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\in V\\;((\\mathcal A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal A))\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\text{-}union\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteUnionClosedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\in V\\;((\\mathcal A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal A))\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantifying over finite subfamilies includes the empty union, so this condition entails <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in C\">\\(\\varnothing\\in C\\)</span> as well as binary-union closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-union.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-union.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-union.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bigcup:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-union.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteUnionClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\te